  "notes": "USAGE:\nA technical term common in science, engineering, IT, and mathematics. Often used as a suru-verb ({解析|かいせき}する). The word carries a more technical nuance than {分析|ぶんせき}, which is the more general word for analysis.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- データ{解析|かいせき} (data analysis)\n- {解析|かいせき}{結果|けっか} (analysis results)\n- {構文|こうぶん}{解析|かいせき} (syntactic parsing)\n- {数値|すうち}{解析|かいせき} (numerical analysis)\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {分析|ぶんせき}: analysis — more general, used in everyday and business contexts\n- {調査|ちょうさ}: investigation, survey — broader in scope, not necessarily technical",
